{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Business is going reasonably well... I wouldn't say I was the richest of merchants ever, but I'm doing fairly well all things considered.","uri":"070ac971d19eb24f295864f418231bc7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Hello! Would you like to trade?","uri":"b10f4930f7405626aa4cd321c85f0c4b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Hey buddy! Get away from my ship alright?","uri":"f573e28587b0a8075a62b0feb84d2a65.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Hey, you gotta take business where you can find it these days! Besides, if I didn't supply them, someone else would.","uri":"71d65002741e2a93e87806e9c0315269.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"I don't think Sir Mordred would like that. He wants as few outsiders visiting as possible. I wouldn't want to lose his business.","uri":"bf9f16c1a45ac75da8967a0d7165dfc4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"I'm waiting on a big delivery of candles which I need to deliver further along the coast.","uri":"d4f5670e558a881e6c07c2b8111a93c7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Oh, various places up and down the coast. Mostly Karamja and Port Sarim.","uri":"e3b857b3212ae1f8c4c62c3831516644.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Sorry pal, but I'm afraid I'm not quite ready to sail yet.","uri":"abd3924596134dde142b2ef100994dc6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Thanks buddy!","uri":"d4b6626a18a3e98bc2f2beb9f69e7894.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Yes, I do have orders to deliver there from time to time. I think I may have some bits and pieces for them when I leave here next actually.","uri":"5123322c749946401da249fceaf17775.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Arhein","text":"Yes, I use it to make deliveries to my customers up and down the coast. These crates here are all ready for my next trip.","uri":"70b97766525b8ec482d5fc12fa8094e3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Beggar","text":"Could you find it in your heart to spare me a simple loaf of bread?","uri":"29c178eeb919b806587f980041f15047.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Beggar","text":"Have you got any bread for me yet?","uri":"629c52efb0a8b2ddde6e171f19c6d589.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Beggar","text":"Please, stranger... my family and I are starving...","uri":"305ab323071ede3c7cb55053e98d08c2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Beggar","text":"Thank you very much!","uri":"1024cf7cfb519d9d898dac874b48db86.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Beggar","text":"Well, if you get some, you know where to come.","uri":"bf9d6aa1748fbc74d31f26ab3dbd0485.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Candle maker","text":"BLACK candles???","uri":"e34015bd6a8a3fc4569d3239e53b7fc1.mp3"}
