{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Candle maker","text":"Hi! Would you be interested in some of my fine candles?","uri":"b832943fe8324c257905c40b5c384494.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Candle maker","text":"Hmmm. In the candle making trade, we have a tradition that it's very bad luck to make black candles.","uri":"658013d47d08c530f65e5589a29bb8ac.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Candle maker","text":"I still dunno...","uri":"db91a26fd1906b8d8867fd4b1b2e2c8e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Candle maker","text":"IF you can bring me a bucket FULL of wax.","uri":"dc80e877927ef3ad9d2dfa6550ae4c6b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Candle maker","text":"VERY bad luck.","uri":"42dc92ea62997744119883f70ef5ace7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"King Arthur","text":"Ah. A good job, well done. I dub thee a Knight Of The Round Table. You are now an honorary knight.","uri":"4a097502c123a682991a290e3c64a8a2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"King Arthur","text":"Be sure that you come speak to me soon then.","uri":"dcc938aaabfd7fc3a1a551d683779e3d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"King Arthur","text":"Really? Well then you will need to go on a quest to prove yourself worthy. My knights all appreciate a good quest.","uri":"459397f2cb3ac3679469284753753bb6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"King Arthur","text":"Talk to my knights if you need any help.","uri":"84d5658bbc7735b88b35c8d17112ceca.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"King Arthur","text":"Unfortunately, our current quest is to rescue Merlin. He recently got himself trapped in some sort of magical crystal. We've moved him from the cave we found him in and now he's upstairs in his tower.","uri":"a0b25cf23a5719444519e60e47bb08f6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"King Arthur","text":"Welcome to my court. I am King Arthur of the Knights of the Round Table.","uri":"5cda4055cb4ba94b6f3bfbbae39b8e1b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"King Arthur","text":"Well then you must complete your quest to rescue Merlin. Talk to my knights if you need any help.","uri":"5415b332cdadda8a38a2d286cbd7922b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Merlin","text":"Go speak to King Arthur, I'm sure he'll reward you!","uri":"8222d2736c20c281e4c8c0339f952624.mp3"}
