{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Merlin","text":"Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!","uri":"a54f1acc72a231467167e67461858fde.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Morgan Le Faye","text":"I suppose I can live with that fool Merlin being loose for the sake of my son.","uri":"e491a6503440ff6bc5f186ac076c6fa1.mp3"}
