{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Morgan Le Faye","text":"STOP! Please... spare my son.","uri":"bb6b897a9d145fa1dee2da4133fcb62d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Morgan Le Faye","text":"The lady of the lake has it. I don't know if she'll give it to you though, she can be rather temperamental.","uri":"f47c1fea1339d96ba937d2fc718b065c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Morgan Le Faye","text":"Then you will need the sword Excalibur with which the spell was bound in order to shatter the crystal.","uri":"807cbf603079b4fbbf61ddf9ccf86e0a.mp3"}
