{"quest":"Merlin's Crystal","character":"Sir Lancelot","text":"Well, if the Knights of the Round Table can't manage it, I can't see how a commoner like you could succeed where we have failed.","uri":"d1e8ba33002d56f53770f14b059b780e.mp3"}
